#29900
"Sheltered Cove - Pebbled Shoreline"
"You are on a narrow strip of beach, covered in coarse sand strewn with small,
smooth pebbles.  South and west, weatherbeaten seacliffs rise, partially
blocking out the sky.  Relatively calm open water lies to the east, sheltered
by the cliffs to the south and those far to the north.  The quaint beach
continues north.
"
