"Sheltered Cove - Pebbled Shoreline"
"You wend your way along this narrow stretch of beach, hemmed in on the west
by towering walls of flawed limestone.  The water to the east is calm and
clear, revealing a sandy bottom dotted by occasional patches of dark stone.  A
gentle sea breeze plays with a patch of dried eel grass, making a small
rustling sound.  The pebbled beach continues north and south.
