"Sheltered Cove - Deep Water"
"Small wavelets lap up disconcertingly around you, occasionally sending sprays
of salt water into your face.  Your nostrils are assailed by the wholesome
odor of seaweed and brine, constantly wafting in on the breeze.  Light
reflects off the water around you, making it difficult to see what lies below.
